Re-shaped after PR #12 fidelity review `5328985210`.

The implementation itself has no remaining Shape-fidelity blocker. The ticket contract now explicitly owns the missing Phase 1 Extension closure:

- exact-PR-head live `gh shoal re-review --agent <supported-agent>` evidence through the locally installed Extension path against controlled GitHub state;
- verification of the canonical event, Star / Unstar state, and thread closure;
- evidence invalidation on any later PR-head change;
- post-merge publication of a new 0.x validation release after `v0.1.0`;
- six-platform asset and Artifact Attestation verification;
- remote install of that exact release and execution of the shipped `re-review` command contract;
- #11 remains open until distribution closure passes.

Product BR remains unchanged; this corrects a Shape-contract omission caused by #11 becoming the final Phase 1 gh Extension feature milestone.
